DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19877::$$$message_0163_0000_0000$$$::I have questions that need answers.[lr]::
19878::$$$message_0163_0000_0001$$$::I don't know anything about the person I'm going to meet.[lr]::
19879::$$$message_0163_0000_0002$$$::All I know is her name and her tense aura.[lr]::
19880::$$$message_0163_0000_0003$$$::Caren.[lr]::
19881::$$$message_0163_0000_0004$$$::Her name has a glass-like ring to it. It reminds me of her slim body.::
19882::$$$message_0163_0001_0000$$$::...I open the door.[lr]::
19883::$$$message_0163_0001_0001$$$::Rays of sunlight pour through the skylight, blinding me.[lr]::
19884::$$$message_0163_0001_0002$$$::The chapel is empty and abandoned, with no residents to be found.[lr]::
19885::$$$message_0163_0001_0003$$$::Instead,[lr]::
19886::$$$message_0163_0001_0004$$$::I find a nun playing a hymn.::
19887::$$$message_0163_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19888::$$$message_0163_0002_0001$$$::Her fingers don't miss a beat at my entrance. Maybe she hasn't noticed me.[lr]::
19889::$$$message_0163_0002_0002$$$::She pays her visitor no mind, focused on her divine task.[lr]::
19890::$$$message_0163_0002_0003$$$::...I feel a little dizzy.[lr]::
19891::$$$message_0163_0002_0004$$$::The organ's notes reverberate and fill the chamber, thanks to its high ceiling.::
19892::$$$message_0163_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19893::$$$message_0163_0003_0001$$$::I start to walk over to the organ, but stop myself.[lr]::
19894::$$$message_0163_0003_0002$$$::Instead, I sit in the furthest pew.[lr]::
19895::$$$message_0163_0003_0003$$$::She'll be done soon, anyway.[lr]::
19896::$$$message_0163_0003_0004$$$::It's not as if this song will go on for hours. I just need to wait until it's over.::
19897::$$$message_0163_0004_0000$$$::The boring tune dulls my thoughts.[lr]::
19898::$$$message_0163_0004_0001$$$::It's so peaceful, I nearly fall asleep. I let her playing guide me into a nap.[lr]::
19899::$$$message_0163_0004_0002$$$::It's a common hymn with nothing noteworthy about it.[lr]::
19900::$$$message_0163_0004_0003$$$::Her finger work isn't anything special, nor do I feel the musician's passion through the song.[lr]::
19901::$$$message_0163_0004_0004$$$::It's a bland melody.[lr]::
19902::$$$message_0163_0004_0005$$$::Workmanlike, as if it's her day job.[lr]::
19903::$$$message_0163_0004_0006$$$::Her performance is like...[wait canskip=0 time=1000]a prayer.::
19904::$$$message_0163_0005_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19905::$$$message_0163_0005_0001$$$::Is this supposed to make worshippers feel something?[lr]::
19906::$$$message_0163_0005_0002$$$::A house of God built by mortals,[lr]::
19907::$$$message_0163_0005_0003$$$::and a hymn composed by them.[lr]::
19908::$$$message_0163_0005_0004$$$::Those from the past must have labored to make believers feel as if they'd entered His holy realm through such performances.[lr]::
19909::$$$message_0163_0005_0005$$$::In order to believe, and to make others believe, everyone together built a space different from their daily lives to express and inspire faith[line len=2]::
19910::$$$message_0163_0006_0000$$$::The foundation of a shared illusion.[lr]::
19911::$$$message_0163_0006_0001$$$::It was a crystallization of prayer to grant their lives comfort and forgiveness.[lr]::
19912::$$$message_0163_0006_0002$$$::That alone made it worthy of God's gaze.[lr]::
19913::$$$message_0163_0006_0003$$$::Even the faithless can feel His presence here.::
19914::$$$message_0163_0007_0000$$$::Though, of course...[lr]::
19915::$$$message_0163_0007_0001$$$::It's too bad that I can't sense the divine.[lr]::
19916::$$$message_0163_0007_0002$$$::Images of ruin fill my head.[lr]::
19917::$$$message_0163_0007_0003$$$::All I can picture is an endless, desolate wasteland.::
19918::$$$message_0163_0008_0000$$$::"...Ugh. I'm gonna puke."[lr]::
19919::$$$message_0163_0008_0001$$$::Still sitting, I rest my face in both hands, and absently wait for the hymn to finish.[lr]::
19920::$$$message_0163_0008_0002$$$::...God and ruin, eh?[lr]::
19921::$$$message_0163_0008_0003$$$::Either way, they're both empty.::
19922::$$$message_0163_0009_0000$$$::The ear-grating music is over.[lr]::
19923::$$$message_0163_0009_0001$$$::She stands up, and the pipe organ disappears from the chapel.[lr]::
19924::$$$message_0163_0009_0002$$$::...That's right. This chapel never held such a magnificent organ to begin with.[lr]::
19925::$$$message_0163_0009_0003$$$::She must have brought it in from the outside.[lr]::
19926::$$$message_0163_0009_0004$$$::However, she managed to make such a large object disappear; it's a vanishing act that could rival any of Caster's magic tricks.[clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
19927::$$$message_0163_0010_0000$$$::The woman doesn't look surprised to see me in the pews. She walks briskly toward me.[lr]::
19928::$$$message_0163_0010_0001$$$::I assumed she didn't even notice me here, but it seems she's been aware the whole time.::
19929::$$$message_0163_0011_0000$$$::"Welcome, Shirou Emiya. This church is in disrepair, as you can see, but I offer you what hospitality I can.[lr]::
19930::$$$message_0163_0011_0001$$$::I believe...[cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽04b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽04b(中)]ah, yes. You must be thirsty. Shall I bring you something to drink?"[lr]::
19931::$$$message_0163_0011_0002$$$::"No thanks. I didn't come here to have tea."::
19932::$$$message_0163_0012_0000$$$::"...I see. I don't know any other way to welcome a guest, so do let me know if you need anything."[lr]::
19933::$$$message_0163_0012_0001$$$::She acts as if I've hurt her feelings.[lr]::
19934::$$$message_0163_0012_0002$$$::...She just mentioned hospitality. Could it be that it's her first time greeting a visitor?::
19935::$$$message_0163_0013_0000$$$::"Let us begin with greetings, then. I already know you are Saber's Master, so you don't need to tell me about yourself.[lr]::
19936::$$$message_0163_0013_0001$$$::What about you? Should I introduce myself?"::
19937::$$$message_0163_0014_0000$$$::"No, that's fine. I already know your name.[lr]::
19938::$$$message_0163_0014_0001$$$::I'll leave after I ask what I came to ask. Save the introductions."::
19939::$$$message_0163_0015_0000$$$::I answer concisely.[lr]::
19940::$$$message_0163_0015_0001$$$::That seems to surprise her, as the conversation halts.::
19941::$$$message_0163_0016_0000$$$::"...So, uh, should I start?"::
19942::$$$message_0163_0017_0000$$$::"...Yes. If you have a question, please ask it.[lr]::
19943::$$$message_0163_0017_0001$$$::I have nothing to ask you.[lr]::
19944::$$$message_0163_0017_0002$$$::...Well, there is one thing now, but it doesn't matter."::
19945::$$$message_0163_0018_0000$$$::"Okay. Then I'll get this over with. I'm tired of wondering."[lr]::
19946::$$$message_0163_0018_0001$$$::I have three questions. I'll start with the most basic one.::
19947::$$$message_0163_0019_0000$$$::"Here's my first question.[lr]::
19948::$$$message_0163_0019_0001$$$::You said you're Caren, right? Who exactly are you?[lr]::
19949::$$$message_0163_0019_0002$$$::Where did you come from, and why are you in Fuyuki? Don't tell me you're just a tourist."::
19950::$$$message_0163_0020_0000$$$::"I am the new minister of this church. Normally, they would never send someone of my station to take over, but in this case they've temporarily assigned me here.[lr]::
19951::$$$message_0163_0020_0001$$$::Perhaps you mages would understand if I referred to myself as an acting representative of the Holy Church."::
19952::$$$message_0163_0021_0000$$$::"Like an Executor, from the Church's combat teams? Those killers who unilaterally censure and dispose of heretics and mages?"::
19953::$$$message_0163_0022_0000$$$::"No, I meant that I am literally here to carry out the Church's will. I lack the abilities of an Executor.[lr]::
19954::$$$message_0163_0022_0001$$$::I've heard that my predecessor was a capable Executor, but I lack the authority and power to judge heresy.[lr]::
19955::$$$message_0163_0022_0002$$$::I am but an apprentice, here to investigate this city on Church orders."::
19956::$$$message_0163_0023_0000$$$::"An apprentice. Is the Church really that shorthanded?[lr]::
19957::$$$message_0163_0023_0001$$$::...And on such a minor errand, too. If they just needed someone to take a look, they could've just as well sent a dog[line len=2]ngh!?"::
19958::$$$message_0163_0024_0000$$$::"They simply sent the person most suited to the task. I may be a humble sister, but I was chosen because I have the appropriate skills.[lr]::
19959::$$$message_0163_0024_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽02a(近)]My task is to investigate the Holy Grail, now that it has been observed once again.[lr]::
19960::$$$message_0163_0024_0002$$$::I am to personally verify the state of the existence of the Holy Grail, which reportedly disappeared in the Fifth Holy Grail War. It is not something just anyone can do."::
19961::$$$message_0163_0025_0000$$$::"...All right, so you're an apprentice with an eye for detail.[lr]::
19962::$$$message_0163_0025_0001$$$::...I get it, so mind letting me go?"::
19963::$$$message_0163_0026_0000$$$::"Your manner of speech is honest, if vulgar. That is good... [cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽04k(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽04k(近)]Very well. I forgive you."::
19964::$$$message_0163_0027_0000$$$::Caren drops her hands and takes a step back.[lr]::
19965::$$$message_0163_0027_0001$$$::That surprised me.[lr]::
19966::$$$message_0163_0027_0002$$$::She suddenly grabbed my face with both hands, her own expression completely deadpan all the while.[lr]::
19967::$$$message_0163_0027_0003$$$::If I had kept belittling her like that, she might have violently headbutted me.::
19968::$$$message_0163_0028_0000$$$::"The Holy Grail was observed... Well, that's a job for the Church, all right, so I'll leave it at that.[lr]::
19969::$$$message_0163_0028_0001$$$::The problem is that they sent you at all. This proves the Holy Grail is back.[lr]::
19970::$$$message_0163_0028_0002$$$::...So, you find it yet?"::
19971::$$$message_0163_0029_0000$$$::"I have verified that something is active which resembles the Holy Grail, but it is not in my custody.[lr]::
19972::$$$message_0163_0029_0001$$$::My role is only to investigate. Anything more would exceed my station."::
19973::$$$message_0163_0030_0000$$$::"Huh... Then you aren't going to try and take it for yourself.[lr]::
19974::$$$message_0163_0030_0001$$$::Hm? Wait, if you're just checking whether the Grail is here or not, aren't you already done?"::
19975::$$$message_0163_0031_0000$$$::"I've accomplished the mission I was sent to do.[lr]::
19976::$$$message_0163_0031_0001$$$::However, I was still sent to represent this church, if only in name.[lr]::
19977::$$$message_0163_0031_0002$$$::The strange events in Fuyuki must be laid to rest."::
19978::$$$message_0163_0032_0000$$$::"...You're contradicting yourself.[lr]::
19979::$$$message_0163_0032_0001$$$::You just said that you're not going after the Holy Grail, but you want to solve the problems it's causing."::
19980::$$$message_0163_0033_0000$$$::"Not to the same extent that you do.[lr]::
19981::$$$message_0163_0033_0001$$$::To be clear, I have two roles.[lr]::
19982::$$$message_0163_0033_0002$$$::Investigating the Holy Grail, and serving as this ministry's acting prelate.[lr]::
19983::$$$message_0163_0033_0003$$$::I must carry out both duties I've been charged with."::
19984::$$$message_0163_0034_0000$$$::"Yeah? So it's just a job, whether you want it or not. Is that why you called me here?[lr]::
19985::$$$message_0163_0034_0001$$$::Great. I'm all for keeping this businesslike. I'll take that over cheap righteousness any day.[lr]::
19986::$$$message_0163_0034_0002$$$::...So, where's the Holy Grail? I bet you know exactly where."::
19987::$$$message_0163_0035_0000$$$::"I sense malice in that remark. [cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽05e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽05e(中)]I can't tell you."[lr]::
19988::$$$message_0163_0035_0001$$$::Caren turns away sulkily.[lr]::
19989::$$$message_0163_0035_0002$$$::I seem to have gotten on her bad side.::
19990::$$$message_0163_0036_0000$$$::"...Fine, whatever.[lr]::
19991::$$$message_0163_0036_0001$$$::Here's my second question.[lr]::
19992::$$$message_0163_0036_0002$$$::What are those monsters? Do they have anything to do with the Holy Grail reappearing and the things happening around town?"::
19993::$$$message_0163_0037_0000$$$::"...I cannot say. I am sworn to silence on this matter.[lr]::
19994::$$$message_0163_0037_0001$$$::It would also insult your dignity if I told you."::
19995::$$$message_0163_0038_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
19996::$$$message_0163_0038_0001$$$::My dignity? I don't think it's that big of a deal.[lr]::
19997::$$$message_0163_0038_0002$$$::Plus, my pride's already in shreds. That's why I'm asking for help. I'll even cheat if it means I'll get the results I want.::
19998::$$$message_0163_0039_0000$$$::"...You don't look pleased. Are you going to force me to tell you?"[lr]::
19999::$$$message_0163_0039_0001$$$::"I already said that I'm not interested in you. When you put it that way, y'know..."[lr]::
20000::$$$message_0163_0039_0002$$$::You make it sound like my irritation and hatred will drive me to defile you. ::
20001::$$$message_0163_0040_0000$$$::"It's fine. I won't press the issue.[lr]::
20002::$$$message_0163_0040_0001$$$::But seriously, what was that? Did the monsters come out of your body?"::
20003::$$$message_0163_0041_0000$$$::I don't know what that was about, but I'm pretty sure it happened.[lr]::
20004::$$$message_0163_0041_0001$$$::...Come to think of it, there's something weird about her.[lr]::
20005::$$$message_0163_0041_0002$$$::She wasn't afraid of the monsters at all. She suddenly got injured, and even released a monster.[lr]::
20006::$$$message_0163_0041_0003$$$::More like a stage magician pulling tricks out of a hat than a real mage, if you ask me.::
20007::$$$message_0163_0042_0000$$$::"You misunderstand.[lr]::
20008::$$$message_0163_0042_0001$$$::Shirou Emiya, have you ever heard of demonic possession?"[lr]::
20009::$$$message_0163_0042_0002$$$::"Demonic possession...?"::
20010::$$$message_0163_0043_0000$$$::I've heard the term before.[lr]::
20011::$$$message_0163_0043_0001$$$::It's a well-known type of spiritual illness in the West, similar to possession by fox and dog spirits in Japan.[lr]::
20012::$$$message_0163_0043_0002$$$::Curse-based magecraft, where a human possessed by something inhuman is destroyed from the inside out.::
20013::$$$message_0163_0044_0000$$$::The symptoms are too varied to lump them all into a single paradigm, but possession in the West is largely caused by entities they call "demons" or "devils."[lr]::
20014::$$$message_0163_0044_0001$$$::Demons possess good humans, for reasons and values beyond human comprehension.[lr]::
20015::$$$message_0163_0044_0002$$$::In contrast to possession in Japan, which is based on the will of the person inflicting the curse, Western curses have no will of their own. They're spontaneous phenomena, like traffic accidents.::
20016::$$$message_0163_0045_0000$$$::Invariably, those afflicted begin as virtuous, ordinary people. They suffer from mental illness, denounce faith and morals, and threaten their family and neighbors.[lr]::
20017::$$$message_0163_0045_0001$$$::Demons make themselves known not through overt violence, but by exposing people as hideous creatures, peeling away their humanity and reason.::
20018::$$$message_0163_0046_0000$$$::Still, that's only the initial symptom of demonic possession.[lr]::
20019::$$$message_0163_0046_0001$$$::When someone is possessed for an extended period, they don't just collapse psychologically.::
20020::$$$message_0163_0047_0000$$$::Severe cases can even result in physical changes.[lr]::
20021::$$$message_0163_0047_0001$$$::The shapeless entity possessing the victim attempts to recreate itself in a human body.[lr]::
20022::$$$message_0163_0047_0002$$$::It begins with alterations that would be unthinkable with a normal physiology, and can result in parts of the victim's body being completely changed.[lr]::
20023::$$$message_0163_0047_0003$$$::The extent of the change depends on the grade of the possessing entity. The stronger the demon, the less human the victim becomes.::
20024::$$$message_0163_0048_0000$$$::...Fortunately, it's impossible to recreate a demon in a human body.[lr]::
20025::$$$message_0163_0048_0001$$$::The deformities invariably result in the victim's death.[lr]::
20026::$$$message_0163_0048_0002$$$::Western demons all come in bizarre forms.[lr]::
20027::$$$message_0163_0048_0003$$$::Twin heads, horse hooves, and six limbs[line len=2]things that can't be mistaken for a regular human with two arms and two legs.::
20028::$$$message_0163_0049_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20029::$$$message_0163_0049_0001$$$::But...[lr]::
20030::$$$message_0163_0049_0002$$$::Very rarely, it's said, there are humans who can survive the changes.[lr]::
20031::$$$message_0163_0049_0003$$$::Not unlike those mages who exhaust their secret art and turn into vampires.[lr]::
20032::$$$message_0163_0049_0004$$$::I've heard of heretics who allow the blueprint we call a soul to be consumed, using the entity consuming that soul to extend their lifespans.[lr]::
20033::$$$message_0163_0049_0005$$$::Meaning that this girl...::
20034::$$$message_0163_0050_0000$$$::"Again, you misunderstand. It isn't pertinent to this topic, but I previously served as an assistant to an exorcist.[lr]::
20035::$$$message_0163_0050_0001$$$::I have never been possessed, and I doubt that I ever will be.[lr]::
20036::$$$message_0163_0050_0002$$$::Demons need healthy bodies to grow. They would never be able to thrive in mine."::
20037::$$$message_0163_0051_0000$$$::"Huh? Then why'd you bring it up?[lr]::
20038::$$$message_0163_0051_0001$$$::...I would've believed you if you said you were possessed."::
20039::$$$message_0163_0052_0000$$$::"...Porca miseria."[lr]::
20040::$$$message_0163_0052_0001$$$::"Rrgh. Did you just say something really foul?"[lr]::
20041::$$$message_0163_0052_0002$$$::"I called you impatient.[lr]::
20042::$$$message_0163_0052_0003$$$::...I am getting to the point. Be quiet and listen."::
20043::$$$message_0163_0053_0000$$$::"Demonic possession causes a number of spiritual afflictions.[lr]::
20044::$$$message_0163_0053_0001$$$::These can range from unexplained sounds associated with poltergeists, to alterations in the possessed person's body.[lr]::
20045::$$$message_0163_0053_0002$$$::...You think of it as an illness that only affects humans who are fertile ground for demons. A poison which does not spread to surrounding people, unlike a virus."[lr]::
20046::$$$message_0163_0053_0003$$$::"Obviously. If possession was as contagious as the common cold, there wouldn't be any normal people left."::
20047::$$$message_0163_0054_0000$$$::"Yeah.[lr]::
20048::$$$message_0163_0054_0001$$$::But just as spiritually sensitive people can perceive demons, there are some who exhibit spiritual illness simply by being in the [font italic=true]proximity[font italic=false] of a possessed victim.[lr]::
20049::$$$message_0163_0054_0002$$$::...I am one such person.[lr]::
20050::$$$message_0163_0054_0003$$$::My unique constitution reproduces the afflictions caused by the beings we call demons, whenever they are nearby.[lr]::
20051::$$$message_0163_0054_0004$$$::'Masochistic Medium's Nature,' my mentor called it."::
20052::$$$message_0163_0055_0000$$$::Caren casually drops a bombshell.[lr]::
20053::$$$message_0163_0055_0001$$$::She's saying some really depressing stuff, if you think about it.[wdash canskip=0]::
20054::$$$message_0163_0056_0000$$$::"...What, so you basically turn into a demon when you get close to one?"[lr]::
20055::$$$message_0163_0056_0001$$$::"...A moronic way of putting it, but close enough.[lr]::
20056::$$$message_0163_0056_0002$$$::My body automatically reproduces the spiritual illnesses caused by demons, to be exact."::
20057::$$$message_0163_0057_0000$$$::"Let's say, for example, that you catch a cold.[lr]::
20058::$$$message_0163_0057_0001$$$::The brunt of your symptoms have yet to occur, so you just feel a bit sluggish.[lr]::
20059::$$$message_0163_0057_0002$$$::...If I were to approach someone like you, I would begin to suffer from cold symptoms.[lr]::
20060::$$$message_0163_0057_0003$$$::In short, my constitution creates a second victim."::
20061::$$$message_0163_0058_0000$$$::"...While it may have harmed you before, it fundamentally doesn't cause trouble for those around me.[lr]::
20062::$$$message_0163_0058_0001$$$::You needn't bother yourself with it."::
20063::$$$message_0163_0059_0000$$$::"You say that, but...[lr]::
20064::$$$message_0163_0059_0001$$$::Well, it's not like I cared before. Still, no dirty tricks, you hear me? Now I'm kinda scared that bad things will happen to me if I get near you."::
20065::$$$message_0163_0060_0000$$$::"That's true. I do suffer from chronic demonic possession.[lr]::
20066::$$$message_0163_0060_0001$$$::Unlike you, I am affected when the monsters are nearby. If it frightens you, then you should get away from me before that happens."::
20067::$$$message_0163_0061_0000$$$::It's a bit unbelievable and I don't pretend to understand it, but I accept the advice.[lr]::
20068::$$$message_0163_0061_0001$$$::Okay, I'd better not get close to her or touch her without a really good reason.[lr]::
20069::$$$message_0163_0061_0002$$$::Wouldn't want us to carelessly hurt each other.::
20070::$$$message_0163_0062_0000$$$::"So, that time..."[lr]::
20071::$$$message_0163_0062_0001$$$::"...Most likely, the monster's spiritual affliction was duplicated in my body.[lr]::
20072::$$$message_0163_0062_0002$$$::While the monsters are weakened, they still are related to demons."::
20073::$$$message_0163_0063_0000$$$::Meaning that the weird stuff won't happen to her as long as the monsters aren't nearby.[lr]::
20074::$$$message_0163_0063_0001$$$::...It stands to reason that the spiritual illness those monsters cause is the creation of similar monsters.::
20075::$$$message_0163_0064_0000$$$::"I believe that is enough about me. Please ask your next question."::
20076::$$$message_0163_0065_0000$$$::"R-right. Here's my third and final question. I want to know more about what's happening in town.[lr]::
20077::$$$message_0163_0065_0001$$$::I don't know why, but the Holy Grail is back.[lr]::
20078::$$$message_0163_0065_0002$$$::We thought that's why the Holy Grail War resumed...but this war has been vague. Like something's wrong with it, somehow.[lr]::
20079::$$$message_0163_0065_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽01b(中)]Tohsaka said that it's being reenacted, not resumed.[lr]::
20080::$$$message_0163_0065_0004$$$::So, even if..."::
20081::$$$message_0163_0066_0000$$$::"Even if there's a Master who wants the Holy Grail, what's the point of continuing an endless war?"::
20082::$$$message_0163_0067_0000$$$::"Well, to keep fighting, probably.[lr]::
20083::$$$message_0163_0067_0001$$$::To continue the finished Fifth Holy Grail War. It's the root of everything that's happening now."::
20084::$$$message_0163_0068_0000$$$::"Your statement that 'something's wrong' is itself strange.[lr]::
20085::$$$message_0163_0068_0001$$$::Something is wrong with this entire city. Somebody's wish has created these false four days."::
20086::$$$message_0163_0069_0000$$$::The girl from the Church mentioned that this is someone's wish.[lr]::
20087::$$$message_0163_0069_0001$$$::That must mean someone has already used the Holy Grail.::
20088::$$$message_0163_0070_0000$$$::"So you're saying this is all [fadebgm time=200 volume=20]fake?"[lr]::
20089::$$$message_0163_0070_0001$$$::Suddenly, I feel like I'm about to die.[lr]::
20090::$$$message_0163_0070_0002$$$::'This is all fake.'[lr]::
20091::$$$message_0163_0070_0003$$$::As soon as those words leave my lips, I feel so despondent that I nearly drop dead.[lr]::
20092::$$$message_0163_0070_0004$$$::It's as if all the heat in the universe suddenly cooled.::
20093::$$$message_0163_0071_0000$$$::"No, only one person is fake.[lr]::
20094::$$$message_0163_0071_0001$$$::As long as all of the characters are assembled, the events playing out over these four days are things that could have happened in reality, even if the time spent wasn't.[lr]::
20095::$$$message_0163_0071_0002$$$::The premise of a reenacted Holy Grail War may be incorrect, but the events that unfold during it are no fantasy."::
20096::$$$message_0163_0072_0000$$$::"These days are quite real.[lr]::
20097::$$$message_0163_0072_0001$$$::Your life will go on, even if this four-day period ends. Shirou Emiya will lose nothing at all."::
20098::$$$message_0163_0073_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20099::$$$message_0163_0073_0001$$$::Who exactly feels relieved by this?[lr]::
20100::$$$message_0163_0073_0002$$$::It probably isn't me.[lr]::
20101::$$$message_0163_0073_0003$$$::But that's okay.[lr]::
20102::$$$message_0163_0073_0004$$$::Her words are the absolute truth.[lr]::
20103::$$$message_0163_0073_0005$$$::My consciousness, on the brink of death, suddenly jolts back to life.::
20104::$$$message_0163_0074_0000$$$::"Okay, glad to hear it. If this is going to keep happening, then I just need to figure out how to fix these four days.[lr]::
20105::$$$message_0163_0074_0001$$$::...So.[lr]::
20106::$$$message_0163_0074_0002$$$::You really have nothing to do with the Holy Grail War being reenacted?"::
20107::$$$message_0163_0075_0000$$$::"I swear it, before the Lord.[lr]::
20108::$$$message_0163_0075_0001$$$::The conversation got sidetracked, but rest assured my objectives are the same as yours: [lr]::
20109::$$$message_0163_0075_0002$$$::to investigate the Holy Grail and bring peace to Fuyuki.[lr]::
20110::$$$message_0163_0075_0003$$$::I will cooperate with you to make these goals happen.[lr]::
20111::$$$message_0163_0075_0004$$$::Of course, all I can do to help you is provide information.[lr]::
20112::$$$message_0163_0075_0005$$$::I cannot interfere in events. As a participant of the Fifth Holy Grail War, you are the only one who can resolve it."::
20113::$$$message_0163_0076_0000$$$::"Why? ...Look, I know you're an outsider. I accept that the person to end the war should be someone who fought in it.[lr]::
20114::$$$message_0163_0076_0001$$$::But why only me? There's Tohsaka and Sakura, too. Any Master could win..."::
20115::$$$message_0163_0077_0000$$$::"This is a reenactment of the Fifth Holy Grail War, which you won.[lr]::
20116::$$$message_0163_0077_0001$$$::Thus, you are the one who should direct this conflict.[lr]::
20117::$$$message_0163_0077_0002$$$::Only Shirou Emiya can bring an end to the Fifth Holy Grail War."::
20118::$$$message_0163_0078_0000$$$::"Listen.[lr]::
20119::$$$message_0163_0078_0001$$$::The only ways to stop this reenactment are for the person who wished it to happen to abandon that desire, or for the previous victor[line len=2]you[line len=2]to defeat them, just as you did before."::
20120::$$$message_0163_0079_0000$$$::"...It sounds like you're playing with words. So you're saying that since the Fifth Holy Grail War is being reenacted, I have to be the one who wins it again?"::
20121::$$$message_0163_0080_0000$$$::"Yes. This is a struggle between Holy Grails.[lr]::
20122::$$$message_0163_0080_0001$$$::Advanced magecraft is a struggle between concepts. Not a contest to see who is stronger, but a measuring of which rule, which order, is the more solid and seamless."::
20123::$$$message_0163_0081_0000$$$::"...I lack the power to refute the order expressed by the Holy Grail.[lr]::
20124::$$$message_0163_0081_0001$$$::The best I can do is to intervene as an advisor. Even if I wish to join, there are regulations that would stop me."::
20125::$$$message_0163_0082_0000$$$::Hmm...[lr]::
20126::$$$message_0163_0082_0001$$$::It sounds like her hands are tied.::
20127::$$$message_0163_0083_0000$$$::"All right. I'm grateful for that. [wvl][se storage=se288.wav][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=-2][se storage=se054.wav]I know what I need to do now."[lr]::
20128::$$$message_0163_0083_0001$$$::I get up.[lr]::
20129::$$$message_0163_0083_0002$$$::This is all I can ask for now, and it's a good time to leave. I want to hurry back to the city.::
20130::$$$message_0163_0084_0000$$$::"You're leaving already...? I would think you have more questions."::
20131::$$$message_0163_0085_0000$$$::"I do, but you don't know the answers to them. Like where the person who wished on the Holy Grail is, or how to get rid of the monsters.[lr]::
20132::$$$message_0163_0085_0001$$$::I'll figure those out on my own. I can just find the culprit and ask them directly for the details. I've got no further use for you or this church."[cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽04k(中)][wvs][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽04k(中)]::
20133::$$$message_0163_0086_0000$$$::I wave a farewell and start walking out.[lr]::
20134::$$$message_0163_0086_0001$$$::I've never liked this church much.[lr]::
20135::$$$message_0163_0086_0002$$$::I'd rather not linger, and to be honest, I don't want to get involved with Caren. I should get out of here.::
20136::$$$message_0163_0087_0000$$$::"Wait. I have just one question for you.[lr]::
20137::$$$message_0163_0087_0001$$$::I answered your questions, so please hear me out."[lr]::
20138::$$$message_0163_0087_0002$$$::"Mrgh."[lr]::
20139::$$$message_0163_0087_0003$$$::She's got me there.::
20140::$$$message_0163_0088_0000$$$::"Fine, but make it brief."[lr]::
20141::$$$message_0163_0088_0001$$$::...Wait, why is she shutting up now?::
20142::$$$message_0163_0089_0000$$$::"Hey. I thought you had a question. Spit it out."[lr]::
20143::$$$message_0163_0089_0001$$$::"...Goodness. You're being even rougher with me than before."[lr]::
20144::$$$message_0163_0089_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
20145::$$$message_0163_0089_0003$$$::My brain grinds to a halt.[lr]::
20146::$$$message_0163_0089_0004$$$::Is that...the question?::
20147::$$$message_0163_0090_0000$$$::"Before? When?"[lr]::
20148::$$$message_0163_0090_0001$$$::"Our previous encounters, as you're aware.[lr]::
20149::$$$message_0163_0090_0002$$$::Back at the park and in the hills, you were a bit more gentlemanly."[lr]::
20150::$$$message_0163_0090_0003$$$::That's not a question. It's just a grievance.[lr]::
20151::$$$message_0163_0090_0004$$$::...This girl is so hard to read. I can't get a grasp on how her mind works.::
20152::$$$message_0163_0091_0000$$$::"I'm in a bad mood today. It's this place.[lr]::
20153::$$$message_0163_0091_0001$$$::I'd feel a little better if we met someplace else."::
20154::$$$message_0163_0092_0000$$$::"...I see. During the day, I have to remain here.[lr]::
20155::$$$message_0163_0092_0001$$$::We can only meet outside at the end of the fourth day, so our relationship will remain the same as it has been."::
20156::$$$message_0163_0093_0000$$$::"Uh-huh. Well, don't worry. I won't be coming back here anyway."::
20157::$$$message_0163_0094_0000$$$::I leave the church for good this time.[lr]::
20158::$$$message_0163_0094_0001$$$::...Seriously, what possessed me to come here?[lr]::
20159::$$$message_0163_0094_0002$$$::I close the door.::
20160::$$$message_0163_0095_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20161::$$$message_0163_0095_0001$$$::...Yeah, that's why I didn't want to get involved with her.[lr]::
20162::$$$message_0163_0095_0002$$$::I never asked her to pray for me.[lr]::
20163::$$$message_0163_0095_0003$$$::It's just, well..[lr]::
20164::$$$message_0163_0095_0004$$$::Doesn't it make me look like a shit magnet?::
919897::$$$message_9163_0004_0000$$$::The boring tune dulls my thoughts.[r]::

